6. Sources and snapshots\nprotocol/core.md:453:### 6.1 Canonical source identity\nprotocol/core.md:476:### 6.2 Git safety and references\nprotocol/core.md:490:### 6.3 External repository source identity and exact lock\nprotocol/core.md:564:### 6.4 Declared and effective external source state\nprotocol/core.md:608:### 6.5 Raw-object snapshot and audit equivalence\nprotocol/core.md:691:## 7. Closure resolution\nprotocol/core.md:711:## 8. Content hashes\nprotocol/core.md:726:### 8.1 Build-source identity\nprotocol/core.md:755:### 8.2 Go toolchain identity\nprotocol/core.md:795:## 9. Compiled-artifact cache and receipts\nprotocol/core.md:797:### 9.1 Local `go-v1` receipt schema 1\nprotocol/core.md:843:### 9.2 External `go-repository-v1` receipt schema 2\nprotocol/core.md:882:### 9.3 Shared protected-cache rules\nprotocol/core.md:928:### 9.4 Protected external snapshots, deduplication, and garbage collection\nprotocol/core.md:957:## 10. Install markers\nprotocol/core.md:1040:## 11. Adapter ledger\nprotocol/core.md:1048:## 12. External build publication and closed extensions\nprotocol/core.md:1050:### 12.1 Publication, shims, and rollback\nprotocol/core.md:1070:### 12.2 Operator credentials and signing\nprotocol/core.md:1087:### 12.3 Future closed-driver admission\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:1:# Decision 0005: external build repositories\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:3:## Context\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:21:## Decision\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:23:### Version boundary\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:36:### Manifest and descriptor ownership\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:61:### Declared and effective source\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:104:### Raw snapshot and audit boundary\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:150:### Receipt, marker, status, and lifecycle\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:185:### Credential, signing, and future-driver ownership\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:211:## Stable failure classes\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:236:## Rejected alternatives\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:257:## Compatibility impact\ndecisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:265:## Security impact\nprofiles/manager.md:1:# Curator Manager Profile 1.0\nprofiles/manager.md:7:## 1. Machine state and configuration\nprofiles/manager.md:50:## 2. Installation lifecycle\nprofiles/manager.md:58:### 2.1 Read-only planning and source gates\nprofiles/manager.md:102:### 2.2 Closed `go-v1` toolchain and process graph\nprofiles/manager.md:189:### 2.3 Dependency and artifact preflight\nprofiles/manager.md:220:### 2.4 Build cache and dry-run planning\nprofiles/manager.md:261:### 2.5 Private build and serialized publication\nprofiles/manager.md:343:### 2.6 Recovery and repair\nprofiles/manager.md:373:## 3. Runtime and project environment\nprofiles/manager.md:421:## 4. Install scopes\nprofiles/manager.md:423:### 4.1 Project\nprofiles/manager.md:428:### 4.2 Global\nprofiles/manager.md:436:### 4.3 Hybrid\nprofiles/manager.md:449:## 5. Agent adapters\nprofiles/manager.md:466:## 6. MCP requirements\nprofiles/manager.md:492:## 7. Source audit policy\nprofiles/manager.md:515:## 8. Shell activation\nprofiles/manager.md:548:## 9. Idempotent machine bootstrap\nprofiles/manager.md:556:## 10. Status and garbage collection\nprofiles/manager.md:585:## 11. External repository manager profile\nprofiles/manager.md:615:### 11.1 Trusted Git distribution, child graph, and clean environment\nprofiles/manager.md:686:### 11.2 Private initialization and exact acquisition\nprofiles/manager.md:797:### 11.3 SSH isolation\nprofiles/manager.md:863:### 11.4 Local-substitution admission\nprofiles/manager.md:936:### 11.5 Raw-object proof\nprofiles/manager.md:1040:### 11.6 Snapshot, audit, and cache ordering\nprofiles/manager.md:1075:### 11.7 Dry-run, offline, and reporting semantics\nprofiles/manager.md:1111:### 11.8 Private build, publication, PATH, and rollback\nprofiles/manager.md:1136:### 11.9 Read-only status, repair, and garbage collection\nprofiles/manager.md:1167:### 11.10 Stable diagnostics and package-controlled behavior\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
